"description":"Live a healthy and happy life with Health Mate!\n\nMonitor heart rate is a major key to overall health. Take daily measurements to track your history by placing your finger on the camera. This powerful heart health app will help you relax and lower heart risk factors. Start now and take all uncertainty out of your health!\n\nWith Health Mate, you can check your pulse, log your blood pressure diary, learn knowledge about health, control your stress level and stay healthy.\n\nHow to use it?\nMake sure your fingers are not wet or too cold. Be sure your fingertip fully covers the lens and flashlight. Hold your phone and keep it steady until the measurement ends. Remember press too hard to influence accuracy. Don't forget to grant access to the camera.\n\nWhy choose Health Mate:\n1. Monitor your cardio health.\n2. Detect your heart rate in different states.\n3. Analyze your stress, recovery and energy level.\n4. Generate time period health reports and easily consult with professionals.\n\nThe Main Advantages of the App:\n- Measure your heart rate with your phone's camera.\n- Track HRV& all your measurements history.\n- Use the diary to monitor your blood pressure and blood oxygen.\n- Gain daily insights about cardio and control heart health risks.\n- Receive reminders to develop healthy habits.\n- To better understand yourself with mental health tests.\n- Follow dash diet recipes to stay fit.\n- Read useful healthy articles to take care of health.\n\nDisclaimer\n- The app is NOT designed for medical use. It is meant only for fitness use and as a source of general health information.\n- The app is not intended to diagnose, prevent or treat any condition, or to be a substitute for a medical tool.\n- The app can only measure heart rate, but not blood pressure or blood oxygen level.\n- Please always consult your doctor if you have a health issue or are concerned about your heart condition.\n\nSubscribe to get unlimited access to all features\nSubscription Option: \n-weekly\n-monthly\n-yearly\n- Your payment will be charged to your iTunes Account as soon as you confirm the purchase.\n- You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal from your Account Settings after the purchase.\n- Your subscription will renew automatically, unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.robentadigital.com/terms-of-service\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.robentadigital.com/privacy-policy", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "PT", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"165465088", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2517, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.532379999999999853343979339115321636199951171875, "sellerUrl":"http://app.robentadigital.com", "artistId":1670142179, "artistName":"Robenta Digital", "userRatingCount":2517}, 
